        "Identify the genetic fallacy in each of these BHI claims and write a one-paragraph response to each: (1) 'The Trinity is false because it was formalised at a Roman council.' (2) 'The KJV cannot be trusted because King James was a white European.' (3) 'Christianity is the slave master's religion, so it must be false.' For each, name the fallacy, explain why origin does not determine truth, and redirect to the actual evidence.",
