        "Name ONE other people who fit ALL the curses. ALL of them. Went into slavery on SHIPS. Scattered to every nation. Called a byword and a proverb. Yoke of iron on the neck. Children taken away.\nYou can't name ONE. We're the ONLY people who fit EVERY curse. That's not coincidence — that's prophecy FULFILLED.\nDon't tell me about the Armenians. They don't fit verse 68 — SHIPS. Only we do.",
